Feature: Tests de securite reseau (nmap) - application Timesheet

Background:
  Given "nmap" is installed
  And the following profile:
    | name           | value       |
    | hostname       | 127.0.0.1   |
    | host           | 127.0.0.1   |
    | tcp_ping_ports | 8082        |

Scenario: L'application Timesheet ecoute bien sur le port 8082
  When I launch an "nmap" attack with:
    """
    nmap -Pn -sT -p 8082 <hostname>
    """
  Then the output should match:
    """
    8082/tcp\s+open
    """

Scenario: Aucun service dangereux (Telnet/FTP) n'est expose
  When I launch an "nmap" attack with:
    """
    nmap -Pn -sT -p 21,23 <hostname>
    """
  Then the output should not contain:
    """
    23/tcp open
    """
